# README.md, LICENSE and CHANGELOG are copied in here from the repo root only
# during `bun pm pack` / `npm publish` (prepack) and removed by postpack. None
# are tracked, so a hard-killed pack never leaves a dirty *tracked* file — the
# leftovers are inert, git-ignored copies. The developer-facing doc for this
# package lives in DEVELOPMENT.md (committed); the npm tarball ships only the
# root marketing README, copied in by prepack.
/README.md
/LICENSE
/CHANGELOG.md
